            Utopia Bold<br />

            Utopia Bold Italic<br />

         </p>

      """ ;
    spdx:name "Adobe Utopia Font License" ;
    spdx:standardLicenseTemplate """Permission to use, reproduce, display and distribute the listed typefaces is hereby granted, provided that the Adobe Copyright notice appears in all whole and partial copies of the software and that the following trademark symbol and attribution appear in all unmodified copies of the software:

